    m_Localized: LIGHT BOMB
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 756890668937220
    m_Localized: Press and hold the Ability button to aim, release to launch a bomb.
      Explodes on impact, dealing AoE damage every {bombTick}s.
